#~ " **size has settled**, that is, seen"
#~ " twice unchanged: a match another "
#~ "program is writing grows from one "
#~ "look to the next, and importing it"
#~ " half-written would give a syntax "
#~ "error nobody can act on. The "
#~ "folder is not walked recursively. A "
#~ "network share that has become unreadable"
#~ " does not stop the watch, and "
#~ "its contents do not pass for new"
#~ " when it comes back."

