#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``--type database`` exports the whole "
#~ "library, like the server export and "
#~ "like the export window when the "
#~ "displayed list is the library: "
#~ "positions, matches, tournaments (with their"
#~ " Direction: journal, pairs, tables and "
#~ "the filing of the exported matches; "
#~ "their event leaves as soon as one"
#~ " of its tournaments does), collections, "
#~ "lessons, Anki decks, transcriptions, aliases"
#~ " and filters. An option set to "
#~ "``false`` removes its family "
#~ "(``--collections=false``); a list of IDs "
#~ "restricts it to those items and "
#~ "includes it. A transcription draft "
#~ "leaves with the match it produced; "
#~ "a draft that has not yet produced"
