#~ "je fauté » ; ``--error-min`` "
#~ "répond à « quelles positions étaient "
#~ "délicates »."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``--error-min`` and ``--move-error-min``"
#~ " do not measure the same thing "
#~ "and **do not take the same unit**:"
#~ " the factor is a thousand. The "
#~ "first is given in equity points "
#~ "(``0.1``), the other two in thousandths"
#~ " (``100``) — one point is worth "
#~ "1000 thousandths. It is ``--move-"
#~ "error-min`` that answers \"where did "
