#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``filter --id <id> --query <query>`` —"
#~ " Makes a collection **living**: its "
#~ "content becomes the result of a "
#~ "search, re-evaluated every time it "
#~ "is opened. The query is written in"
#~ " the application's own search grammar "
#~ "(see :ref:`cmd_filter`). ``--clear`` turns it"
#~ " back into a hand-made list, "
#~ "keeping the positions it already held."

