#~ "d'une base (``--db`` et ``--id``) ; "
#~ "sans ``--store``, rien n'est enregistré."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Plays a position a large number of"
#~ " times with gammonNet, to settle what"
#~ " a search cannot: two moves a "
#~ "few thousandths apart, or a cube "
#~ "decision where the model hesitates. With"
#~ " dice, it is its moves that are"
#~ " played (the best ones at the "
#~ "rollout depth, at least 2 plies, "
#~ "or those named by ``--move``); without"
