#~ " (``0.0.0.0``, ``[::]``) est sondée sur "
#~ "l'interface de bouclage."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "``--addr`` — Address the daemon listens"
#~ " on (default ``BLUNDERDB_ADDR``, else "
#~ "``:8080``). An address without a host"
#~ " (``:8080``) or with a wildcard host"
#~ " (``0.0.0.0``, ``[::]``) is probed on "
#~ "the loopback interface."

#~ msgid ""
