#~ "câblée, sans rien à tenir à jour"
#~ " à la main."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Prints a shell completion script for "
#~ "the subcommand names to standard output."
#~ " The command list embedded in every"
#~ " script is generated from the same"
#~ " table ``blunderdb help`` and ``main.go``'s"
#~ " dispatch read (``handlers()``): a new "
#~ "subcommand is therefore offered by "
#~ "completion as soon as it is wired"
#~ " in, with nothing to keep up to"
#~ " date by hand."

#~ msgid ""
